# Profiles are kept in this directory (presets/profile/<name>.conf).
#
# This file keeps the directory itself alive: presets.py:default_dir falls back to the old
# layout (presets/ directly) if presets/profile is NOT a directory, and mistakes the
# bar/terminal/launcher presets for profiles. Since Git doesn't store empty directories,
# this is exactly what would happen in a fresh clone if all profiles were ever deleted.
#
# Which real setup each profile here is based on: docs/preset-sources.md
# Record of the older generation extracted from screenshots: docs/gallery-catalog.md
